e=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"site_search_form\" />\n<div data-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions-mobile\">\n\n<button  data-drupal-selector=\"site-search-form-button\" type=\"submit\" id=\"site-search-form-button-mobile\" name=\"op\" value=\"Submit\" class=\"button js-form-submit form-submit btn btn--primary\">\n  Submit\n  <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n  </svg>\n</button></div>\n\n</form>\n\n      </div>\n\n</div>\n\n      </li>\n        </ul>\n          </div>\n    </div>\n      \n\n  </nav>\n  </div>\n    </header>\n        <div id=\"main-wrapper\" class=\"o-main-wrapper clearfix\">\n      <div id=\"main\" class=\"clearfix\">\n        \n        <main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n                            \n\n<div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n\n                              \n                      <article class=\"h-relative\">\n  \n  \n<div class=\"h-relative\">\n  <div class=\"c-banner-medium c-banner-medium--media\">\n    \n  \n    \n    <div class=\"c-banner-medium__element c-banner-medium__element--color\" style=\"background:#222222\">\n      <div class=\"c-banner-medium__column\" style=\"color:#222222\">\n                  <img src=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/her/public/2026-02/ST6_TUC_Still%20%282%29.jpg?h=6c42f703&amp;itok=zrUH2fOG\" class=\"c-banner-medium__img\" alt=\"\"/>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-banner-medium__overlay\">\n      <div class=\"c-banner-medium__container | o-container\">\n        <div class=\"c-breadcrumb  | js-breadcrumb\">\n              <span class=\"visually-hidden\">You are here:</span>\n    <ol class=\"o-list c-breadcrumb__links\">\n    \n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/\">\n                          <svg class=\"o-icon c-breadcrumb__divider-icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n                <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n              </svg>\n                        Home\n          </a>\n              </li>\n          <li>\n                  <a href=\"/see-and-do\">\n                        See and do\n          </a>\n              </li>\n        </ol>\n\n        </div>\n\n                <h1 class=\"visually-hidden\"><span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country (PG) </span>\n</h1>\n\n        <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"c-banner-medium__title | o-title o-title--primary\">\n          <span class=\"js-cascade\"><span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country (PG) </span>\n</span>\n        </div>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n    <div class=\"o-main-content | js-sticky-container\">\n    <!-- Body content -->\n    <div class=\"o-body -first\">\n      <div class=\"o-container u-order\">\n        <div class=\"o-content u-order-body\">\n          <div class=\"c-wysiwyg\">\n              <div class=\"o-text-introduction\">\n                            <p>Experience the powerful sixth and final installment of the original <em>Star Trek</em> film series, <em>Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country</em> (1991), on one of the biggest screens in the UK.</p>\n\n      \n              </div>\n                          <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">As the Cold War–like tensions between the Federation and the Klingon Empire reach breaking point, Admiral James T. Kirk (William Shatner) and the crew of the </span><em><span lang=\"EN-US\">U.S.S. Enterprise</span></em><span lang=\"EN-US\"> are drawn into a deadly conspiracy that threatens to plunge the galaxy into chaos.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">This sixth and concluding chapter of the original </span><em><span lang=\"EN-US\">Star Trek</span></em><span lang=\"EN-US\"> film saga delivers thrilling suspense and political intrigue, serving as a powerful and fitting farewell to the legendary original crew.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Starring William Shatner, Leonard Nimoy, DeForest Kelley, George Takei, Nichelle Nichols and Walter Koenig, this final voyage stands as a poignant and dignified conclusion to a cinematic era, honouring both the legacy and enduring spirit of </span><em><span lang=\"EN-US\">Star Trek</span></em><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><div class=\"embedded-entity\"><div>\n                  <div class=\"video-embed-field-provider-youtube video-embed-field-responsive-video\"><iframe width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RYA2q2Sm_Jo?autoplay=0&amp;start=0&amp;rel=0\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n      \n  </div>\n</div><ul><li><em><span>Star Trek VI: The Undiscovered Country</span></em><span> (PG), 1991, UK/USA, dir. Nicholas Meyer, 110 mins.</span></li><li><em>TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026</em><span>&nbsp;Par. Pics.&nbsp;</span></li></ul>\n      \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"o-sidebar-wrapper-fixed  u-order-sidebar | js-sticky-sidebar\" data-sidebar-spacer=\"false\">\n          <div class=\"o-container\">\n            <div class=\"o-sidebar\">\n              <div>\n                <h2 class=\"visually-hidden\">Information</h2>\n                \n\n\n<div class=\"c-info-block c-info-block--primary\">\n  <ul class=\"c-info-block__list o-list\">\n        <li class=\"o-title o-title--tertiary c-info-block__title -first\">\n                  Film\n      \n    </li>\n        <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                  <li><span class=\"o-label\">Date:</span>             Friday 1 May 2026\n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Time:</span>             19.15  <br />\r\n\n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Duration:</span>             110 minutes \n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Price:</span>              From £14 \n      </li>\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Location:</span> IMAX: The Ronson Theatre\n      <span class=\"separator\">, </span>\n  Level 0</li>\n                <!-- Age and Height Restrictions -->\n                          <li><span class=\"o-label\">Age:</span>             PG\n      </li>\n                <!-- Festival \"parents\" -->\n              </ul>\n    </li>\n            <li class=\"c-info-block__section\">\n      <ul class=\"o-list\">\n                <li>\n          <a href=\"https://my.sciencemuseum.org.uk/0/447015\" class=\"btn btn--primary -on-black\">\n            Book now\n            <svg class=\"o-icon btn__icon\" role=\"presentation\">\n              <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-bold-right\"></use>\n            </svg>\n          </a>\n        </li>\n                      </ul>\n    </li>\n                \n    \n  </ul>\n</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n                    \n<div class=\"o-body\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"o-content\">\n      <section class=\"slice view-mode-default c-accordion clearfix | js-accordion\" >\n              \n        <h2  class=\"c-accordion__section-title\">            Visit Information\n      </h2>\n                                  <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-1\">\n\t  <span>            About your visit\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-1\">\n              <h4>Are you serving food/drinks? Can I bring my own food/drink?&nbsp;</h4><p>We sell drinks and snacks in our concessions area. You can bring your own bottle of water, however food from outside the IMAX cinema is not permitted.&nbsp;</p><h4>How long before showing do I need to arrive?&nbsp;&nbsp;</h4><p>Our concessions area will be open from 18.15. We recommend arriving at the cinema at least 15 minutes before the time printed on your tickets.</p><h4>Will toilets be available?&nbsp;</h4><p>There are toilet facilities available near the concessions area and towards the back of the IMAX cinema on level 3.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-2\">\n\t  <span>            Accessibility\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-2\">\n              <h4>Is there step-free access to the auditorium and concession area?&nbsp;</h4><p>Yes, there is step free access to the auditorium. Please ask at our IMAX ticket desk and a staff member will escort you to your seats.&nbsp;</p><h4>Are there spaces reserved for wheelchair users in the auditorium?&nbsp;</h4><p>Yes, there are four&nbsp;spaces available for wheelchair users. Please call our call centre on 033 0058 0058 to book.&nbsp;</p><h4>Do you provide hearing loops?&nbsp;</h4><p>Yes, we do have hearing loops available. Just speak to a member of staff upon arrival.&nbsp;</p><h4>Are there accessible toilet facilities?&nbsp;</h4><p>Yes, accessible toilets are located near the IMAX concessions area and outside the main auditorium&nbsp;</p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n          <h3 class=\"c-accordion__title\">\n\t<button class=\"c-accordion__tab | js-accordion-tab\" id=\"tab-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab-content-3\">\n\t  <span>            Tickets\n      </span>\n\t  <svg class=\"c-accordion__icon\">\n\t    <use xlink:href=\"#arrow-accordion-down\"></use>\n\t  </svg>\n\t</button>\n</h3>\n\n<div class=\"c-accordion__content clearfix\" id=\"tab-content-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-3\">\n              <p>Should you wish to amend your order, tickets can be refunded up until 12.00 the day before the screening or moved to a different date up until two hours before. Amendments must be made over the phone via our contact centre. Lines are open each day between 9.00–17.00. Beyond this point tickets cannot be amended or refunded.</p>\n      \n  \n</div>\n\n      \n                </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n          <section class=\"o-section -primary\">\n  <div class=\"o-section__padding\">\n              <div class=\"o-container\">\n                  <h2 class=\"visually-hidden\">            Gallery\n      </h2>\n                      </div>\n              <div class=\"c-carousel c-carousel--gallery -offset | js-carousel\" data-carousel-style=\"offset\">\n        <div class=\"c-swiper-btn-pos\">\n          <button class=\"c-swiper-btn -back | swiper-button-back\">\n            <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Previous slide</span>\n            <svg><use xlink:href=\"#arrow-thin-right\"></use></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"c-swiper-btn-pos\">\n          <button class=\"c-swiper-btn | swiper-button-next\">\n            <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Next slide</span>\n            <svg><use xlink:href=\"#arrow-thin-right\"></use></svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"swiper-container\">\n            <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n                \n                            \n  \n  \n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n  <div class=\"c-media\">\n    <figure class=\"c-media__figure\"\n            data-large-image-width=\"506\"\n            data-large-image-height=\"755\"\n            data-large-image-url=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/smg_carousel_zoom/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_1.jpg\"\n            data-title='The original 1991 movie poster for Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country. '\n            data-credit=\"TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.\"\n            data-link=\"\"\n            data-link-text=\"\">\n                                  <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"image-carousel\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_1.jpg?itok=GeE0bXrU 1x\" width=\"469\" height=\"700\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_1.jpg?itok=GeE0bXrU\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n\n      \n      <figcaption class=\"c-media__caption\">\n        <p>The original 1991 movie poster for Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country. </p>\n        <cite>TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.</cite>\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          \n  \n  \n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n  <div class=\"c-media\">\n    <figure class=\"c-media__figure\"\n            data-large-image-width=\"1600\"\n            data-large-image-height=\"1074\"\n            data-large-image-url=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/smg_carousel_zoom/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_2.jpg\"\n            data-title='An iconic scene from Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country.'\n            data-credit=\"TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.\"\n            data-link=\"\"\n            data-link-text=\"\">\n                                  <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"image-carousel\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_2.jpg?itok=izrVx1dF 1x\" width=\"1043\" height=\"700\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_2.jpg?itok=izrVx1dF\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n\n      \n      <figcaption class=\"c-media__caption\">\n        <p>An iconic scene from Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country.</p>\n        <cite>TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.</cite>\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n          \n  \n  \n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n  <div class=\"c-media\">\n    <figure class=\"c-media__figure\"\n            data-large-image-width=\"1600\"\n            data-large-image-height=\"1067\"\n            data-large-image-url=\"https://www.sciencemuseum.org.uk/sites/default/files/styles/smg_carousel_zoom/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_3.jpg\"\n            data-title='The cast on set for Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country. '\n            data-credit=\"TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.\"\n            data-link=\"\"\n            data-link-text=\"\">\n                                  <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"image-carousel\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_3.jpg?itok=w2CE_g1c 1x\" width=\"1050\" height=\"700\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/carousel/public/2026-02/The%20Undiscovered%20Country_Carousel_3.jpg?itok=w2CE_g1c\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n\n      \n      <figcaption class=\"c-media__caption\">\n        <p>The cast on set for Star Trek: The Undiscovered Country. </p>\n        <cite>TM CBS Studios Inc. © 2026 Par. Pics.</cite>\n      </figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n      \n            </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      </div>\n</section>\n\n      \n    \n  </div>\n</article>\n              \n\n<section class=\"o-section -secondary\" aria-labelledby=\"a-see-more-films\">\n    <div  class=\"slice view-mode-default o-container clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"o-container__padding\">\n                  <h2 id=\"a-see-more-films\" class=\"o-title o-title--section\">            See more films\n      </h2>\n                                      <div class=\"slice view-mode-grid-4-column\">\n      <div class=\"js-carousel-teaser\" data-carousel-slidesPerView=\"1\"> \n  <div class=\"o-grid o-grid--4-col\">\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/star-trek-60-film-season\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST_Nemesis_Still_KS_0005_186d1a470cf2b545ef0caa46626acbbbfe4d950b_0.jpg?h=4e0c70af&amp;itok=q972f3hV 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST_Nemesis_Still_KS_0005_186d1a470cf2b545ef0caa46626acbbbfe4d950b_0.jpg?h=4e0c70af&amp;itok=q972f3hV\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek at 60 Film season</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            Festival\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                          <p>            Celebrate the 60th anniversary of Star Trek and experience the entire cinematic legacy, from the original voyages of Captain Kirk to the modern reboot trilogy, <br />\r\n\n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/star-trek-the-motion-picture\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST_THE_MOTION_PICTUREpromo.png?h=87c939dd&amp;itok=i6p8uijz 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST_THE_MOTION_PICTUREpromo.png?h=87c939dd&amp;itok=i6p8uijz\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek: The Motion Picture (PG)—Director’s Edition</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            Film\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Thursday 26 March 2026\n      </span>\n                          <p>            The original Star Trek adventure, Star Trek: The Motion Picture (1979), returns, fully restored, for the ultimate big-screen experience. \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card \">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/star-trek-ii-the-wrath-of-khan\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST2_Wrath_Still_0.jpg?h=3a7c63f8&amp;itok=DPFVmcoi 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST2_Wrath_Still_0.jpg?h=3a7c63f8&amp;itok=DPFVmcoi\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan (12A)—Director&#039;s Cut</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            Film\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Thursday 2 April 2026\n      </span>\n                          <p>            A thrilling second installment in the Star Trek film franchise, Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan (1982), delivers unforgettable action and emotional depth on one of the biggest screens in the UK. \n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"o-grid__item\"><article class=\"c-card -feature\">\n  <a href=\"/see-and-do/star-trek-v-the-final-frontier\" class=\"c-card__link\">\n        <div class=\"c-card__img\">\n      <div>\n                      <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"teaser-11-7\" srcset=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST5_Frontier_Still_.jpg?h=72822391&amp;itok=kRiJ_Os7 1x\" width=\"550\" height=\"350\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/11_7/public/2026-02/ST5_Frontier_Still_.jpg?h=72822391&amp;itok=kRiJ_Os7\" alt=\"\" />\n\n\n\n      \n  </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-card__content\">\n    \t<h3 class=\"c-card__title o-title o-title--secondary\">\n        <span class=\"h-relative\">Star Trek V: The Final Frontier (PG)</span>\n\n      </h3>\n            <div class=\"c-card__info\">\n          <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Category: </span>            Film\n      \n      </div>\n            <div class=\"c-card__desc\">\n                  <span class=\"c-card__date\">            Wednesday 22 April 2026\n      </span>\n                          <p>            Experience the epic fifth installment of the legendary Star Trek film franchise, Star Trek V: The Final Frontier (1989), on one of the biggest screens in the UK.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\n      </p>\n                          <span class=\"c-card__tag\">            Book now\n      </span>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</article>\n</div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n      \n              </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n      \n\n\n        </main>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <footer>\n      <div class=\"c-social-panel | js-sticky-footer\">\n  <div class=\"o-container\">\n    <div class=\"c-social-panel__wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"js-social-shares | c-socia